update public.personalities set image_prompt = 'Dress the pet as a modern, stylish young CEO: a sleek, perfectly tailored slim-fit suit jacket in deep emerald green, a crisp white shirt with an open collar (no tie), a silk pocket square and a smart watch on one front paw; no trousers. It sits upright on its haunches on a big minimalist white desk, like a real animal, looking straight at the camera with a confident, bossy look, both front paws resting on the desk, one of them placed on a neatly coiled colourful dog lead (leash) as if to say it is time to go. If the pet is a large dog, it stands tall instead, right behind the desk like the big boss, its long neck and big chest well above the desk and both front paws resting on the desk, one on the lead; cats and small or medium dogs sit on the desk as described. A sleek laptop beside it. A bright, modern glass-walled office high above the city, plants and designer furniture. No people, no readable text.'
where id in ('pt-chefe', 'en-chefe', 'es-chefe', 'fr-chefe');
